{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37934","headline":"过长江贾岛主簿旧厅 · 崔涂","name":"过长江贾岛主簿旧厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雕琢文章字字精，我经此处倍伤情。\n身从谪宦方沾禄，才被槌埋更有声。\n过县已无曾识吏，到厅空见旧题名。\n长江一曲年年水，应爲先生万古清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}